  "incident": "npm supply-chain compromise of chalk/debug and 17 related packages",
  "date": "2025-09-08",
  "root_cause": "Maintainer 'Qix' was phished via a fake npm 2FA-reset email from the look-alike domain npmjs.help (registered 2025-09-05). The attacker captured username, password and a live TOTP code and took over the account.",
